WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.042 --> 00:00:02.959
(indie rock music)

00:00:07.069 --> 00:00:10.717
(tires crumble through dirt and rock)

00:00:10.717 --> 00:00:12.453
- [Voiceover] Every year
the world's most elite

00:00:12.453 --> 00:00:14.138
mountain bikers gather in France

00:00:14.138 --> 00:00:17.136
for a race unlike any other.

00:00:17.136 --> 00:00:18.048
(exhales and speaks in foreign language)

00:00:18.048 --> 00:00:20.106
(indie rock music)

00:00:20.106 --> 00:00:23.950
- It's the longest
downhill race in the world.

00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:25.675
(indie rock music)

00:00:25.675 --> 00:00:26.508
- [Voiceover] That's right.

00:00:26.508 --> 00:00:29.494
Megavalanche is the longest
downhill race in the world.

00:00:29.494 --> 00:00:33.093
18 miles long, 10,000 feet
high in the French Alps

00:00:33.093 --> 00:00:35.201
and a crazy starting line of 3,000

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:37.310
cyclists on a mountain peak.

00:00:37.310 --> 00:00:39.041
This is Remy Absalon.

00:00:39.041 --> 00:00:41.424
He won the Megavalanche.

00:00:41.424 --> 00:00:43.911
- I start mountain bike when I was young

00:00:43.911 --> 00:00:46.479
and your own mountain bike is really cool

00:00:46.479 --> 00:00:50.146
because we can explore
all around the world.

00:00:52.191 --> 00:00:56.072
Megavalanche Alpe d'Huez
takes place in the French Alps

00:00:56.072 --> 00:01:00.239
in Alpe d'Huez so not so far
of Italy and Switzerland.

00:01:01.713 --> 00:01:04.989
It's really high in the Alps so you have a

00:01:04.989 --> 00:01:08.239
very good view, 360 degrees around you.

00:01:10.604 --> 00:01:12.663
(indie rock music)

00:01:12.663 --> 00:01:16.496
It's really crazy, I
don't know why I do that.

00:01:17.491 --> 00:01:21.090
(rock music and slow hand clapping)

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:23.103
You ride all kind of terrain.

00:01:23.103 --> 00:01:27.926
First the glacier and after
the rocky sections, the forest.

00:01:27.926 --> 00:01:30.843
(indie rock music)

00:01:31.717 --> 00:01:35.462
It's really physical with some happiness.

00:01:35.462 --> 00:01:37.713
So when you cross the
line and you are first,

00:01:37.713 --> 00:01:41.630
you are really happy and
you want to try again.

00:01:42.533 --> 00:01:45.450
(indie rock music)

